<Routines Use="Context">
<Routine Use="Target" Name="Time" Type="RLL">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Timekeeping Routine]]>
</Description>
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[==========================================================================================================================================================
                                                                                                                      Time : Time management for the system

                                                    List of treatments handled by the routine :
                                                         - Create the seconds tick
                                                         - Timers Loop
                                                    -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                    History 
		2019-DEC-24 - Merck - Q. Spindler - Initial version for Candidate Release 1.00.00.00.a
                                2020-APR-06 - Merck - Q. Spindler - Modifications for Candidate Release 1.00.00.00.b
Add TimerControl.NewTickMainTask
==========================================================================================================================================================]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Create the seconds tick
==========================================================================================================================================================
Reset when value is equal or greater than 999999.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[GEQ(TimerControl.Cycle,999999)CLR(TimerControl.Cycle);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Master counter of task cycle time (25ms). Always running]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(TimerControl.Cycle,TimerControl.Cycle+1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Convert the amount of cycle time to seconds by dividing by 10.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[DIV(TimerControl.Cycle,40,TimerControl.Seconds);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Check the system seconds register, save the value and set the seconds tick if changed.  This creates a flag that is on for one processor scan each second.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NEQ(TimerControl.Seconds,TimerControl.Save)[MOV(TimerControl.Seconds,TimerControl.Save) ,OTE(TimerControl.Tick) ,OTL(TimerControl.NewTickMainTask) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Timers Loop
==========================================================================================================================================================
The FOR NEXT loop will index through all timers.  The index value is equal to the array subscript value for the Timers UDT array.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[FOR(Time_Loop,Index,0,21,1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Use="Reference" Name="Time_Loop">
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
</Programs>
